---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="What is WPM? | TypeMeter" description="Understand WPM, raw WPM and accuracy and how they reflect typing performance.">
  <article class="page-shell narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Guide</p>
    <h1>What is WPM?</h1>
    <p>Words per minute is the standard measure of typing speed. TypeMeter uses correct characters divided by five and divided by elapsed minutes to calculate WPM.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
